        <PlanSection number="10" headingId="other-suggestions" title="Other Suggestions">
          <p class="note">Thank you Jordy and Becca</p>
          <ul>
            <li data-comment-anchor="suggestion-kayak"><strong>Kayak on Lake Wakatipu.</strong> See the lake and mountains from the water. Choose a calm day; check rental options and conditions before heading out.</li>
            <li data-comment-anchor="suggestion-gardens"><strong>Visit Queenstown Gardens.</strong> An easy walk from town through lakeside gardens, with mountain views and space for a picnic. A good option for a quiet afternoon.</li>
            <li data-comment-anchor="suggestion-lake-cruise"><strong><a href="https://www.realnz.com/en/experiences/day-cruises/queenstown-lake-cruise/">Lake Wakatipu cruise — RealNZ.</a></strong> A relaxed 90-minute scenic cruise aboard Spirit of Queenstown, departing from Steamer Wharf in town. A gentler local option than Shotover Jet, without the full-day journey to Milford Sound.</li>
            <li data-comment-anchor="suggestion-milford"><strong>Day trip to Milford Sound.</strong> A fiord cruise beneath steep cliffs and waterfalls. It is a long return journey from Queenstown, so allow a full day and consider a coach-and-cruise trip.</li>
          </ul>
        </PlanSection>
